<h1>12_系统属性、优劣特征与因果关联 (Attributes, Qualities, Flaws & Relations)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>1207</b> 个高阶抽象概念词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表）• 支持右上角 <b>🇬🇧 英语 / 🇫🇷 法语（含冠词与阴阳性）</b> 一键切换</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_优势、效能、精髓与核心价值 (39)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_缺陷、漏洞、弊端与反常异象 (4)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_特征、属性、真实性与复杂程度 (715)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_因果、关联、差异、比例与层级结构 (449)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_优势、效能、精髓与核心价值 (Merits, Efficacy, Essence & Worth)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 39 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>efficiency</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'efficacité<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 efficiency</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/i'fiʃәnsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/efikasite/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('efficiency', 'l\'efficacité')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 效率, 效能, 功效</td><td class='def-en'>the ratio of the output to the input of any system</td><td>4.38</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of efficiency (the ratio of the output to the input of any system).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> ratio</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>utility</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le travaux publics<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 utility</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ju:'tiliti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tʁavo pyblik/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('utility', 'le travaux publics')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 功用, 有用之物, 实用, 公用事业, 实用程序</td><td class='def-en'>a company that performs a public service; subject to government regulation</td><td>4.27</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of utility (a company that performs a public service).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>public utility</span><span class='syn-tag'>public utility company</span><span class='syn-tag'>public-service corporation</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> service</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>significance</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'importance<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 significance</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/sig'nifikәns/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃pɔʁtɑ̃s/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('significance', 'l\'importance')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 重要性, 意义, 意味</td><td class='def-en'>the quality of being significant</td><td>4.18</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“do not underestimate the significance of nuclear power”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> importance</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>merit</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la mérite<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 merit</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'merit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/meʁit/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('merit', 'la mérite')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 优点, 功绩, 价值, 功过, 真相</td><td class='def-en'>any admirable quality or attribute</td><td>4.08</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“work of great merit”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>virtue</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> worth</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>marginal cost<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le coût marginal<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 marginal cost</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'mɑ:dʒinәl kɒst/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ku maʁʒinal/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('marginal cost', 'le coût marginal')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[计] 边缘成本, 边缘价格；[经] 边际成本</td><td class='def-en'>the increase or decrease in costs as a result of one more or one less unit of output</td><td>3.82</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of marginal cost (the increase or decrease in costs as a result of one more or one less unit of output).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>incremental cost</span><span class='syn-tag'>differential cost</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> monetary value</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>greatness</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la grandeur<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 greatness</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'greitnis/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/gʁɑ̃dœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('greatness', 'la grandeur')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 大, 巨大, 广大</td><td class='def-en'>the property possessed by something or someone of outstanding importance or eminence</td><td>3.71</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of greatness (the property possessed by something or someone of outstanding importance or eminence).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>illustriousness</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> importance</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>nominal value<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la valeur nominale<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 nominal value</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'nɒminl 'vælju:/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/valœʁ nɔminal/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('nominal value', 'la valeur nominale')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[化] 标称值；[经] 表面价值, 面值</td><td class='def-en'>the value of a security that is set by the company issuing it; unrelated to market value</td><td>3.59</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of nominal value (the value of a security that is set by the company issuing it).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>par value</span><span class='syn-tag'>face value</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> value</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>superiority</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la supériorité<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 superiority</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/sju:.piәri'ɒriti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/sypeʁjɔʁite/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('superiority', 'la supériorité')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 优越, 高傲</td><td class='def-en'>the quality of being superior</td><td>3.59</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of superiority (the quality of being superior).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>high quality</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> quality</div></div></td></tr>
